      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton has just launched pre-orders for its 2026 Fall-Winter Men's collection on the official website. This season's bags feature a new Silk Tech fabric—a blend of silk and technical fibers that is water-resistant, wrinkle-resistant, and lightweight. From a distance, it resembles the classic Monogram canvas, blending functionality with trompe-l'œil artistry.",
