    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Silk Tech fabric is a blend of 51% mulberry silk and 49% recycled nylon, finished with a water-resistant, wear-resistant, wrinkle-resistant coating and a tear-resistant fabric lining. It offers a lightweight, flexible texture with a distinctive sheen. This season, it appears on styles like the Alma Shoulder bag, Speedy handbag, Nil messenger bag, and Track backpack, accented with supple VVN leather trim. The collection reinterprets the house's iconic codes with a contemporary eye, merging practicality with refined craftsmanship.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
