    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Dandy Duffle 50 is crafted from Monogram Archive canvas with a spacious rectangular silhouette. Leather corner guards lend a vintage elegance, while the full-length zipper allows the bag to open flat for easy packing. The Locker Dopp Kit Cargo features a washable fabric lining and adjustable side handles for hanging on bathroom hooks or racks. The Horizon four-wheel suitcase gains exterior multi-functional pockets, adding extra utility to this already capable carry-on.",
