    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Shopper Tote now comes in a new Nano size, measuring 19.5 x 15 x 7.5 cm—compact enough to hold a phone, a short wallet, and keys. Top handles and an adjustable shoulder strap offer multiple carrying options. Inspired by the brand's classic shopping bag, the design is rendered in smooth calfskin with a contrasting leather logo. The Mini Shopper Tote appears in refreshing mint green and sky blue, exuding a youthful vibe.",
