      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Speedy P9 line introduces reversible styles this season. The size 40 features Monogram leather with a red quilted Nappa lambskin interior, while the size 30 comes in apple-green Monogram leather with a white Buttersoft leather lining. The diamond quilting echoes the traditional lining of Louis Vuitton trunks. A detachable metal handle can be fixed on either side, allowing the reversible design to showcase two distinct looks with a retro-futuristic flair.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
